      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Before the first query",
      "items": [
        "The memory backend builds chunks + vectors during build_retriever",
        "pgvector and Qdrant are indexed once by coderag ingest and persist"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Hybrid is optional",
      "items": [
        "dense returns store.query directly and skips BM25 + RRF",
        "hybrid fuses the two rankings with reciprocal rank fusion",
        "hybrid+rerank adds a cross-encoder pass on the fused candidates"
      ]
    },
